        <div class="markdown-body">
            <h2>Split delivery policy</h2>
            <p>Split an order into <strong>two shipments</strong> when <em>either</em> condition holds:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>More than 20 lines are waiting for stock</li>
                <li>A <code>priority</code> flag is set on the customer</li>
            </ul>
            <blockquote>Never split and change the carrier in the same decision — the warehouse loses the audit trail.</blockquote>
            <pre><code>if (waiting &gt; 20 || customer.IsPriority)
order.Split();</code></pre>
            <p>See the <a href="#">carrier matrix</a> for which carrier takes the second shipment.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
